<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>The Soothsayer likes the Gators: Franz Beard on Florida vs. Ole Miss</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Franz Beard's five keys to beating No. 4 Ole Miss, and why The Swamp can swing it. Kickoff 3:30 p.m. ET on ABC.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Newsreader" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,600;6..72,700&amp;display=swap" />
    <mj-font name="Inter" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&amp;display=swap" />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#14243D" font-size="16px" line-height="1.55" />
      <mj-button background-color="#FA4616" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0" inner-padding="14px 22px" font-size="13px" font-weight="800" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .gb-wordmark { font-weight:900; letter-spacing:-1.8px; }
      .gb-h1 { font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif; font-size:36px; line-height:1.06; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.5px; }
      .gb-quote { font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif; font-size:22px; line-height:1.3; font-style:italic; }
      @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
        .gb-h1 { font-size:29px !important; line-height:1.1 !important; }
        .gb-quote { font-size:19px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F2F0EB" width="640px">

    <mj-section background-color="#FA4616" padding="10px 24px">
      <mj-column width="70%">
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" font-size="13px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="3px" padding="0">FRANZ BEARD &middot; THE SOOTHSAYER</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="30%">
        <mj-text align="right" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="11px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" padding="1px 0 0">GAME DAY</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="16px 24px 12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0">
          <a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/?utm_source=gatorbait_franz_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=franz_soothsayer_2026_09_26&amp;utm_content=masthead" style="text-decoration:none;"><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:32px;color:#003B7A;">GATOR</span><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:32px;color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span></a><br/>
          <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:3px;color:#003B7A;">MEDIA</span>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/16b519_2a7933014a7843219af45f97978af5ec~mv2.jpg" alt="Florida Gators. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-soothsayer-is-feeling-some-very-good-vibes-about-the-florida-gators?utm_source=gatorbait_franz_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=franz_soothsayer_2026_09_26&amp;utm_content=cover_image" padding="0" width="640px" />
        <mj-text align="right" color="#AEBBD0" font-size="11px" padding="6px 14px 8px">Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="26px 30px 6px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px" color="#081B35"><span class="gb-h1">The Soothsayer is feeling some very good vibes about the Florida Gators</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 14px" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1.2px" color="#5F6B7A">BY FRANZ BEARD</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 14px">Two years ago, a top-10 Ole Miss team came into The Swamp as an 11.5-point favorite and left with a 24-17 loss. Now the No. 4 Rebels are 3.5-point underdogs to No. 21 Florida, and Franz says the Gators can do it again.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="4px 30px 4px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px" color="#D8450C" font-size="12px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="2px">FRANZ&rsquo;S FIVE KEYS</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px"><strong>1.</strong> Keep Trinidad Chambliss contained in the pocket.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px"><strong>2.</strong> Tall defensive linemen keep their hands up.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px"><strong>3.</strong> With coverage and pass rush, don&rsquo;t let the Ole Miss receivers get deep.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px"><strong>4.</strong> A steady diet of Jadan Baugh, especially in the second half.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 16px"><strong>5.</strong> Lots of play action for Aaron Philo.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 30px 8px">
      <mj-column border-left="5px solid #FA4616" padding="4px 0 4px 16px">
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#081B35"><span class="gb-quote">&ldquo;Buster Faulkner delivers a paybacks are hell offensive game plan and Brad White&rsquo;s rushers off the edge keep the pocket collapsed. Jadan Baugh moves way up the Heisman Hopeful list.&rdquo;</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1.2px" color="#5F6B7A">THE SAYER SAYS SOOTH</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 30px 6px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 18px" font-size="15px"><strong>Update:</strong> Ole Miss has ruled out running back Kewan Lacy (left shoulder), one of 10 Rebels out. <a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/kewan-lacy-not-expected-to-play-ole-miss-florida?utm_source=gatorbait_franz_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=franz_soothsayer_2026_09_26&amp;utm_content=lacy_update" style="color:#D8450C;font-weight:700;">Read the latest</a>.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-soothsayer-is-feeling-some-very-good-vibes-about-the-florida-gators?utm_source=gatorbait_franz_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=franz_soothsayer_2026_09_26&amp;utm_content=read_full" align="left" padding="0 0 26px">READ FRANZ&rsquo;S FULL PREDICTION</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="22px 30px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#FA7A45" font-size="11px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="2px" padding="0 0 6px">KICKOFF</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" font-size="19px" line-height="1.35" font-weight="800" padding="0 0 6px">No. 4 Ole Miss (3-0) at No. 21 Florida (3-0)</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#D5DFEC" font-size="15px" line-height="1.5" padding="0 0 14px">3:30 p.m. ET on ABC from Ben Hill Griffin Stadium. Buddy Martin, Franz Beard and Loren Meadows are in The Swamp, with photographer Chris Spears.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/?utm_source=gatorbait_franz_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=franz_soothsayer_2026_09_26&amp;utm_content=gameday_homepage" align="left" padding="0" background-color="#FFFFFF" color="#081B35">ROSTERS &amp; GAME DAY UPDATES</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 26px 22px">
      <mj-column width="40%">
        <mj-text padding="0" color="#003B7A" font-size="18px" font-weight="900">GATOR<span style="color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span> MEDIA</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="60%">
        <mj-text align="right" color="#667386" font-size="11px" line-height="1.55" padding="0">Florida football. All the time.<br/>GatorBaitMedia.com &middot; Old-school journalism + new tech.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
